	<section_number>45.2-518</section_number>
	<catch_line> Records of the Board</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Chief shall preserve in his office a record of the meetings and transactions of the Board of Coal Mining Examiners and of all certificates issued by the Board.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-27; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-11; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.26; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
